{
    "title": "Forza Customs - Restore Cars",
    "description": "The Forza Customs crew are here to bring you some unloved classics, to restore them to their former glory and beyond. Transform dreams into reality with amazing car customizations! Solve puzzles to help design, customize and tune the perfect set of wheels.\r\n \r\nThis is the ultimate car-themed puzzle game!\r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\n - Customize cars with a retro look or go modern? You decide, you design!\r\n - Design and modify different types of cars and vehicles, including fun classics, high performance track cars, and more.\r\n - Express yourself with an incredible variety of car components, paint finishes, wraps and accessories.\r\n - Experience addicting gameplay with offline mode so you can take the game wherever you go.\r\n - Be challenged by puzzles and dozens of game modes for endless car-themed fun.\r\n - Frequent, fresh and free content updates with exciting new projects and live challenges to take on.\r\n \r\nTime to get matching and transform these wrecks into gleaming new metal!\r\n \r\nStart your Forza Customs journey now!\r\n\r\nNeed help?\r\n\r\nYou can reach out to us in-game by going to Settings -> Help & Support, or alternatively you can raise a support ticket by heading here - https://hutch.helpshift.com/hc/en/15-forza-customs/contact-us/\r\n\r\nFollow us!\r\n\r\nInstagram - https://www.instagram.com/forzacustomsgame\r\nFacebook - https://www.facebook.com/forzacustomsgame\r\nX - https://twitter.com/forza_customs\r\nTikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@forzacustomsgame\r\nYoutube - https://www.youtube.com/@forza_customs\r\nTwitch - https://www.twitch.tv/forzacustomsgame\r\n\r\nJoin the community on the Official Forza Customs Discord Server!\r\n\r\nhttps://discord.gg/forzacustoms",
    "descriptionHTML": "The Forza Customs crew are here to bring you some unloved classics, to restore them to their former glory and beyond. Transform dreams into reality with amazing car customizations! Solve puzzles to help design, customize and tune the perfect set of wheels.<br> <br>This is the ultimate car-themed puzzle game!<br> <br>Features:<br> - Customize cars with a retro look or go modern? You decide, you design!<br> - Design and modify different types of cars and vehicles, including fun classics, high performance track cars, and more.<br> - Express yourself with an incredible variety of car components, paint finishes, wraps and accessories.<br> - Experience addicting gameplay with offline mode so you can take the game wherever you go.<br> - Be challenged by puzzles and dozens of game modes for endless car-themed fun.<br> - Frequent, fresh and free content updates with exciting new projects and live challenges to take on.<br> <br>Time to get matching and transform these wrecks into gleaming new metal!<br> <br>Start your Forza Customs journey now!<br><br>Need help?<br><br>You can reach out to us in-game by going to Settings -&gt; Help &amp; Support, or alternatively you can raise a support ticket by heading here - https://hutch.helpshift.com/hc/en/15-forza-customs/contact-us/<br><br>Follow us!<br><br>Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/forzacustomsgame<br>Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/forzacustomsgame<br>X - https://twitter.com/forza_customs<br>TikTok - https://www.tiktok.com/@forzacustomsgame<br>Youtube - https://www.youtube.com/@forza_customs<br>Twitch - https://www.twitch.tv/forzacustomsgame<br><br>Join the community on the Official Forza Customs Discord Server!<br><br>https://discord.gg/forzacustoms",
